>\n\n      <p class=\"text-xs leading-snug text-white/55 max-w-[560px] mx-auto uppercase tracking-wider\">\n        Augment your practice with data-driven insights and commanding precision — cultivating an environment of absolute authority.\n      </p>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Feature Grid -->\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-6 gap-4 md:gap-5\">\n\n      <!-- Card 1 -->\n      <div class=\"md:col-span-2 relative h-[300px] md:h-[340px] group transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/[0.075] transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-[#FF5500]/22\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 24px) 0, 100% 24px, 100% 100%, 24px 100%, 0 calc(100% - 24px)); pointer-events: none;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-[1px] bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#171717,#111111)] p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#1b1714,#141414)]\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 23px) 0, 100% 23px, 100% 100%, 23px 100%, 0 calc(100% - 23px));\">\n          <div class=\"mb-auto\">\n            <div class=\"inline-flex w-12 h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.03] backdrop-blur-sm\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:scale-outline\" class=\"text-[26px] text-[#FF5500] transition-all duration-500 group-hover:text-white group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight uppercase transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-[#FF5500]\">Courtroom Strategy</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-xs leading-snug text-white/60 uppercase tracking-wider\">\n              Maintain absolute focus during complex litigation. Drive persuasive arguments before the bench.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Card 2 -->\n      <div class=\"md:col-span-2 relative h-[300px] md:h-[340px] group transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"transition-delay: 50ms;\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/[0.075] transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-[#FF5500]/22\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 24px) 0, 100% 24px, 100% 100%, 24px 100%, 0 calc(100% - 24px)); pointer-events: none;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-[1px] bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#171717,#111111)] p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#1b1714,#141414)]\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(0 0, calc(100% - 23px) 0, 100% 23px, 100% 100%, 23px 100%, 0 calc(100% - 23px));\">\n          <div class=\"mb-auto\">\n            <div class=\"inline-flex w-12 h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.03] backdrop-blur-sm\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-two-rounded-linear\" class=\"text-[26px] text-[#FF5500] transition-all duration-500 group-hover:text-white group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:rotate-6\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight uppercase transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-[#FF5500]\">Counsel &amp; Advisory</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-xs leading-snug text-white/60 uppercase tracking-wider\">\n              Build trust and maintain control through precise, empathetic client communications.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Card 3 -->\n      <div class=\"md:col-span-2 relative h-[300px] md:h-[340px] group transition-transform duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1\" style=\"transition-delay: 100ms;\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/[0.075] transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-[#FF5500]/22\" style=\"clip-